    {
      "content": "Martin weighs \\(55\\) kg.\n\nCarl weighs:\n\\[\n55+18=73\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nThe total weight of these two men is:\n\\[\n55+73=128\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nIf the other two men weigh \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) kg, the average of all four is:\n\\[\n\\frac{128+x+y}{4}\n\\]\n\nBecause the weights of the other two men are not provided, the average cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Actually, that was wrong. Carl's weight is 16 kg more than Martin's weight.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Martin weighs \\(55\\) kg.\n\nCarl weighs:\n\\[\n55+16=71\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nTheir combined weight is:\n\\[\n55+71=126\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nIf the other two men weigh \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) kg, the average weight of all four men is:\n\\[\n\\frac{126+x+y}{4}\n\\]\n\nSince the other two weights are not given, the average cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Oh, I forgot to mention: Christian's weight is 8 kg more than Carl's weight.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Martin weighs \\(55\\) kg.\n\nCarl weighs:\n\\[\n55+16=71\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nChristian weighs:\n\\[\n71+8=79\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nThe total weight of these three men is:\n\\[\n55+71+79=205\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nIf the fourth man weighs \\(x\\) kg, the average is:\n\\[\n\\frac{205+x}{4}\n\\]\n\nSince the fourth man's weight is not given, the average cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Insufficient information}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "Great. Now let's take that a step further. How much heavier is Christian than Martin?",
      "role": "user"
