    {
      "content": "Christian weighs \\(79\\) kg, and Martin weighs \\(55\\) kg.\n\n\\[\n79-55=24\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{24\\text{ kg}}\n\\]",
      "role": "assistant"
    },
    {
      "content": "I should also tell you: Harry's weight is 5 kg less than Christian's weight.",
      "role": "user"
    },
    {
      "content": "Harry weighs:\n\\[\n79-5=74\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nThe four men’s total weight is:\n\\[\n55+71+79+74=279\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\nTheir average weight is:\n\\[\n\\frac{279}{4}=69.75\\text{ kg}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{69.75\\text{ kg}}\n\\]",
